WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.780
Chara-su!

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.660
Everyone, today we're...

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.560
Shugo-shugo peppy!

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.480
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.310
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.670
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.270
Unlock!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.450
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.760
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.630
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.480
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.360
you're like a dream.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.100
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.940
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.740
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.540
Whenever I start something new

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.250
I get really excited,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.920
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.060
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:58.700
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.490
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:06.620
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:11.240
It's party time!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.990
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.730
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:22.930
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.140
It's party time!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.850
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.360
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.990
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.780
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.830
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.420
"Yodel-Ay-Ee-Oooo!"

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.850
I have done it! I have finally summited this mountain peak!

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.680
No more...

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:10.100
Pitiful weaklings.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.180
You're just way too into this, Kiseki.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.360
Hmph. It's thanks to my constant drive for perfection.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.120
It echoed off the mountain!

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.030
Let's try it ourselves!

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.840
Cool!

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.350
Wow!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:34.360
Hey! How dare you neglect me!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.200
Now, now... Calm down.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.550
Why don't you try, Kiseki?

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.140
Me? Act like you commoners?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:42.600
Well... Maybe just this once...

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.370
Dummy!

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.870
Dummy! Dummy!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.550
What the heck is this?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.260
Dummy!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.650
Love!

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:01.800
Villainy! So it was <i>you</i>!

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:05.730
What're you gettin' all happy about climbin' such a dinky mountain?

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:08.600
Dinky? This mountain is taller than yours!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.480
"This mountain is taller than yours!"

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.360
This one's taller!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.170
"This one's taller!"

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.510
You leave me no choice! It's an all-out offensive!

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.050
I guess there's no other way.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.720
This mountain is taller than yours!

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:25.730
Damn it! El, say something!

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.980
Understood!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.770
Love!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.080
What have you been blabbing, anyway?

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.540
El loves the mountains.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.030
So I'm expressing those feelings!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.850
Love!

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.100
Victory is ours, yes.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.160
What's this?

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.240
Love!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.480
My feelings have gotten through to the mountain!

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:03.000
This is a miracle! The great power of love!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.100
Now everyone all together:

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.120
Love!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.600
Love!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.890
See you again!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.630
Shugo Character Encyclopedia!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.200
Character Introductions!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.640
First up is...

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.990
Soma Kukai!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:28.580
Kukai is a former Jack's Chair of the Seiyo Academy Guardians!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.720
He's a bright and energetic young man!

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:38.320
Now that he's graduated to middle school, he's like the older brother the Guardians can rely on.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.530
Continuing with the second person...

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:54.270
Sanjo Kairi!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:59.570
Kairi is a former Jack's Chair of the Guardians!

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.400
He's a very smart and mature boy.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:09.330
He transferred schools after confessing to Amu-chan that he liked her...

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.870
I wonder what he's doing? I hope he's well!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.370
We'll continue doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions every week!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.920
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.790
Shugo-shugo Open Heart Game!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.430
All right! We're starting a new game today!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:34.190
We'll do a quick personality quiz to help you understand who you really are!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:37.500
Your hidden secrets might all be revealed!

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.100
Everyone watching at home, you play too!

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:41.520
So, here's the question:

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:45.590
Which Guardian Character would you like to Character Transform with?

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:47.540
Choose between these four!

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.490
Eggs, choose which one you'd like to Character Change with!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.390
Spade, have you decided?

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.290
Ran!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.040
Diamond?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.110
Ran.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:55.900
Heart?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:56.810
Miki.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:57.860
Clover?

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:58.650
Dia.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:00.310
I see...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.030
Has everyone at home decided?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.870
Now, we'll announce the results!

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:10.920
Which Guardian Character would you like to Character Transform with?

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:17.270
We can find out what kind of boy you'd like to go out with from your answer!

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:23.230
For those who chose Ran, you love sporty boys that are really active!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.530
Am I right?

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.520
Umm...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.780
Not really...

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.700
The people who chose Miki like boys who act mature.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.840
Do you like older guys?

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.190
I wonder...

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:44.620
For girls who chose Dia, you like cute guys who look like they belong in a boy band!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.970
Am I right?

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.030
Maaayybbee...

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:53.270
And you also have confidence in your own looks!

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.610
You think?

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.850
No, not at all!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.400
And for those of you watching at home that chose Su...

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:05.610
You like boys that are sweet and will fawn over you!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:06.870
Okay!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:11.700
Today we learned that Clover only cares about people's looks!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.590
No, that's not true!

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:16.250
She's denying it so passionately!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:19.380
That's right! What's important is what's inside their heart!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:20.040
Right!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.940
What about all you viewers at home?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:27.180
Until the next Shugo-shugo Open Heart game!

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.750
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.290
"Shugo Bomber - Part 4!"

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.150
Egg Rangers! Shugo Bomber!

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.820
Shugo Base, Reborn!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:56.170
Huh? Where'd the Shugo Base go?

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.100
Which means...

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.530
Shugo Bomber's finally over!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:01.450
Miki!

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:02.480
Huh?

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.060
Dia, what's the matter?

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:10.360
So you're safe, Ran?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.170
Safe?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:16.330
The Shugo Base was destroyed after the X Egg Empire counterattacked.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.310
No one knows where the Commissioner and everyone are...

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.770
It's still going on...

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:24.720
At this rate, the world will fall into the hands of evil!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:27.080
We cannot allow that to happen!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.190
That voice!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:30.750
From above?!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.280
Commissioner! You were unhurt!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.190
Worry not!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.340
The heart of justice will never lose!

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:42.900
I predicted that this day might come, so I constructed a new Shugo Base!

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.080
Shugo Base V2!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.580
It's completely the same!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.290
Look carefully! V2!

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.200
In other words, it stands for version 2.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:58.080
It's crucial for heroes to power up sometime during the fight.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.720
I figured that it was about that season.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.260
Uh, if you say so...

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:05.470
Well done making it here, Commissioner.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.100
As well as our Shugo Bomber brothers.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.420
Miki, where have you been?

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.440
I am not Miki!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.280
Call me Professor Miki!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.830
Professor Miki is a scientist in the Shugo Bomber science devision!

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:18.880
Et tu, Miki?

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.580
Well, I kind of asked her if I could do a scientist role, so...

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.290
"Kind of?!" You're totally into it!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.170
Professor Miki has helped Shugo Bomber power up!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.270
Exactly!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.950
Equip the new Shugo Bomber suits!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.170
There's some suspicious antennae sticking out!

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.710
Yes! They are the symbol that shows you've powered up.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.950
You now possess a million times the power you had before!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.780
Ah... Sometimes I even frighten myself...

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.560
Power up is completed!

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.230
But our days of battle still continue!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.570
Onward, invincible Shugo Bomber!

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.270
Miki, you traitor!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.770
See you again!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:02.910
Coming up next is Shugo Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:05.930
Today's episode is "That Sparkling Treasure!"

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.790
Which is Rikka-chan's treasure, I wonder?

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:29.250
What's really important?

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:35.300
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:42.560
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:53.900
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:58.620
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:02.990
They're all precious things.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:07.160
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.690
Everything'll be okay.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.750
Because even if you feel lost,

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:15.180
you're not alone.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:17.340
We'll always be together.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.980
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:23.010
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.190
Open Heart, now!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.850
You can see the eggs, right?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:32.860
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:38.700
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.920
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.090
Have you gotten used to school?

00:11:56.090 --> 00:12:00.870
I remember all the systems and practices of "school," yes.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.030
I see.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:07.270
Then, um... Hikaru...

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.720
I know it's late, but congratulations on starting school.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:26.180
It's a fountain pen.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:29.520
I finally received the order.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:34.170
This is from the brand with the number one share in the world, isn't it?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.060
Yes, and inside is the highest quality-

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:40.440
But, I don't use a fountain pen.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.260
So I don't need it.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.810
I suppose that's true...

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.410
11 - That Sparkling Treasure!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.770
You've got to be kidding me!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:02.090
It's gone! Gone! Gone!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.340
Goone!

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:07.340
Where did it gooooo?!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.310
So, we're going to look for it.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.060
Look for what?

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.780
My pendant! It's my treasure.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.700
It's pink, and sparkly, and shaped like a flower and...

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.220
Where could it have gone?!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:26.790
Is it really something that valuable?

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:30.500
Yeah... 'Cause it's...

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:35.250
You look cute, Rikka. Smile for me!

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:40.200
Last year during the school entrance ceremony, I was kind of nervous.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.270
I didn't know if I could make new friends.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.210
Or if the teachers would be scary...

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.090
So then...

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.770
A present to celebrate you entering elementary school, Rikka!

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:55.270
Thanks!

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:10.450
Wonderful! It suits you perfectly, Rikka!

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.340
I thought it might be a little too early to give this to you, but...

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:16.490
But just for today, you can dress up like a big kid!

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:19.400
Thanks Mom! Thanks Dad!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:29.070
When I wore it, I felt like everything will be okay.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.070
That's why it's my treasure!

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.730
I've worn it ever since I transferred here!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.690
A present from your dad, huh?

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.270
It really is something to treasure.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:40.590
Right!

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:43.370
Okay then, we'll find it for sure!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.690
Yeah!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.870
Thanks!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:50.550
First thing, Rikka, is for you to tell us exactly where you've been.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:52.170
We'll start with the classroom, right?

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.230
Nope.

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:54.490
Before that...

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.870
I went to say hi to the flower beds.

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.070
It's not here.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:07.980
Then I said hi to the baby chicks.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:11.410
And said hi to the rabbits.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:16.120
And said hi to the flowers in the Royal Garden...

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.730
I have a feeling I went somewhere else, too...

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:21.230
Rikka-chan...

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.090
Before you went to class...

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.710
You went all over the place...

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.380
Quite a distance you travel...

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.910
But I feel like I went a bunch of other places...

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.900
There's more?

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.800
Um... Anyway!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.620
Let's search the classroom!

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.140
I guess it's really not here.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.530
Where did you go besides the classroom?

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:47.770
That's it! Second period was arts and crafts!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.550
Third period was music...

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.640
I cooked in the home ec classroom...

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.670
I can't find it...

00:15:57.670 --> 00:16:00.290
Any other places you remember?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.640
Nope!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.440
I've never been around here before.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.980
Huh? What's that?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:11.070
This is the planetarium.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.530
Planetarium?

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.200
You mean the place where you can see stars?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.670
There was one of those in the school?

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:18.970
Awesome!

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.320
Ah, Rikka-chan!

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:22.300
You're not supposed to go in there!

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.540
I wanna see the stars!

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.890
I think she's lost track of her objective...

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:34.930
Hey!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.910
Amu-senpai!

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.700
You're not supposed to be in here.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:44.890
I was searching for something, and just happened in here.

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:46.470
Searching for something?

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.920
A present?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.380
Yeah.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.420
So, where should we search next?

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:56.130
You're gonna help me search?

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.940
It's something important to you, right?

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:00.200
Senpai!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.110
There's no other places?

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:08.090
I just can't remember.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:16.010
So when you went to say hi to the flowers and birds... Did you end up chasing something?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.760
When I saw the flowers in the morning,

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.960
there was this pretty butterfly...

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:24.980
And I chased it!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.580
That's got to be it!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.270
Good going, Amu-chan!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:32.900
It seems like you've got Rikka-chan's patterns down to a science!

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.450
So after that, what happened?

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:39.830
I ended up in a tree.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.540
You climbed a tree again?!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.010
That's it!

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:50.130
It must have slipped off then!

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:59.920
Something's shining!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.060
Where?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.770
Wait!

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:09.110
Why'd a crow take it?

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:13.660
Crows have an instinct to collect shiny things.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.420
Anyway, we have to go after it!

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.310
Right!

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.150
Wait!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.620
Wait!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.240
Wait!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.070
Ran!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.840
Let's go!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.080
Okay, Amu-chan!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:32.670
My heart:

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.630
Unlock!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.830
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.530
Heart Speeders!

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.700
Give back Rikka's precious thing!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.620
Please, Mr. Crow!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:10.950
All right!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:14.220
Pom-pon Pom Special!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.390
Rikka-chan!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.140
Rikka!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.910
Rikka!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.340
Yay!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.220
Are you okay?

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.290
You really overdid it there.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:01.970
Sorry.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:17.670
Okay, we've dried your clothes with Remake Honey, so let's get going.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.570
Right!

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:20.640
This is...

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:21.650
It's fake!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.110
There's no silver or platinum...

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:29.410
This metal thing with no value is your treasure?

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:34.260
Well, it's important to me no matter what you say.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:36.290
That's right.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:41.130
Things you receive from other people are special, no matter what they are.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.220
Why?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.850
Well...

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:49.310
Because of the feelings put into them, I suppose.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.600
Like "Congratulations!" or "Good luck!"

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.700
Someone other than you is thinking about you.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.630
It's pretty amazing, you know?

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.100
Didn't you say you didn't need it?

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.120
It's not like it'll get in my way or anything.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.620
And I might have an opportunity to use it.

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:46.750
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:50.800
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.230
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.960
Guardian Egg Love Fortune!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.220
First, for the people who chose Su's egg...

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:05.900
Four Shugoluck Stars! Super lucky!

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:09.380
Go have fun in a group with your crush!

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:11.710
You might get a chance to be alone together!

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:14.230
The people who chose Ran get three Shugoluck stars.

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.670
You'll have a chance to strike up a conversation with your crush!

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.670
Put on a smile and talk cheerfully!

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:16.690
Don't be shy, and talk to them!

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:18.640
The people who chose Dia get two Shugoluck stars.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:21.360
Don't forget to act like a girl!

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:21.360
You might get your crush to turn and look at you

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:24.670
Finally, for those of you who chose Miki's egg...

00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:27.890
You get, um... one Shugoluck star...

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:30.460
You might be treated coldly by the person you have a crush on.

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:33.530
But that just happens once in a while when they're in a bad mood.

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:35.330
Lucky Item: Gloves

00:22:33.530 --> 00:22:35.330
Don't let it get to you!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:40.820
Today was really fun!

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:43.400
See everyone for next week's Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:46.860
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:48.250
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
